      "writtenOn": "2024-11-01T00:51:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure we need these constants added to the API.\n\n1. these are used I expect for input validation, not as default values.\n2. you will not be able to update them in the future without an API bump (say you want to change the min RX packet size).",
